<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66392" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσημβρ-ία</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσος,
		ἡμέρα</span>), 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσαμβρίη</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
		</span></i> (v. infr.), <i><span class="en">
			Arr.
			<u>Ind.</u>
			3.8
		</span></i>, al.: ἡ:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>midday</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ἐκ μεσημβρίης ἔθηκε νύκτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					74
				</span></i>
			. 
			<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν μεσημβρίας θάλπει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					746
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκλιναμένης τῆς μεσαμβρίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.104
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσαμβρίης</span> at
			<i>noon</i>, ibid.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτρωγ᾽ . . σῦκα τῆς μεσημβρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					463
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				106
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				500
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ μεσαμβρίῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν μεσημβρίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.100
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύκτα ἐν μ. ἐπαγόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					897d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμα μεσημβρίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.3.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ μεσημβρίας</span> just after
				<i>noon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				372
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμικρόν τι μετὰ μεσημβρίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1499
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤδη ἦν μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					220c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἵσταται</span> 'tis high
				<i>noon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				242a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the South</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μολοσσῶν πρὸς μεσημβρίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hecat.
					108
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμὸς] ῥέων ἀπὸ μεσαμβρίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖται πόλις πρὸς
			μεσαμβρίην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				142
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πρὸς μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.113
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.3073.95
			</span></i> (Lebad., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσημβρῑη</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.369
			</span></i>.]</div>
